--------------------
MODULES README
--------------------

These are Lyntin modules.  To install a new Lyntin module,
just dump the file in this directory and it will be automatically
picked up the next time Lyntin runs.  Lyntin will attempt to
import the module and if it isn't good, then Lyntin will inform you
that it wasn't able to import the module.

If you're working on a module and don't want it imported, change
the name to have a _ in the front--Lyntin won't try to dynamically
import any modules with a _ in the front of their name.

More information to appear here regarding building modules.
